# Website FormFieldGroup

Authority: `docs/platforms/website/flow-form-foundation.md` §3.4b.

## Law

Related fields that share one title/explanation use `FormFieldGroup` (`website/src/app/ui/components/form/FormFieldGroup.tsx`).

- Required `title` (`cardTitle` / `textPrimary`).
- Optional `subTitle` (`caption` / `textSecondary`).
- Chrome: `cardBackground` + `shellBorder` + `card.radius`; `p={1.15}` `gap={1.15}`.
- Children are the fields.

## Forbidden

- A one-off bordered `Col` that copies this chrome.
- Putting the group explanation on the first field’s `subTitle`.
- Using `SectionHeading` or `FormInputWrapper` as the cluster card.
- Changing padding/tokens at a call site — edit the shared component.

## Reference

- Component: `website/src/app/ui/components/form/FormFieldGroup.tsx`
- Consumer: `CustomerOrganizationScreen` identity colors
- Flow: `flow-form-foundation.md` §3.4b, `flow-customer-organization.md` §4.1
